    "The 2025-01-17 photo shows 16845 on the meter display. It has not been checked against any earlier reading and does not confirm the reading was taken at a particular time.",
    "Setting the next date does not confirm the tenant will send the photo.",
    "The landlord's 15 September date supersedes the original 'every 3 months / mid June' schedule. The 'every 3 months' cycle after September is not confirmed by the landlord."
  ],
  "remaining_work": [
    "On or before 2025-09-01 (FUP-101): ask the tenant for the 15 September solar photo and chase if needed.",
    "Send the September photo to the landlord before 15 September 2025.",
    "Confirm the ongoing recurrence with the landlord, since their note gives only one date."
  ],
  "missing_info": [
    "Landlord's ongoing recurrence after September 2025 (the original request said every 3 months)."
  ],
  "outcome": "action_taken",
  "severity": "routine",
  "summary": "The June reading was obtained and sent to the landlord on 2025-01-17. The landlord then set the next reading for 15 September 2025, which replaces the earlier mid-June date. The job is on hold with a follow-up on 2025-09-01 to request the next photo, and both the landlord and tenant have been messaged.",
